"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[8647],{8647:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/metamorphosis.png\\"\\n          title=\\"The Metamorphosis\\"\\n          author=\\"Franz Kafka\\"\\n          publisher=\\"The Classic\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2018-11-20\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9791189581992\\"\\n          rating=5\\n          tags=\\"novel\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nHe lived faithfully supporting his family as the head of the household, but as soon as he turns into a monster, the family members gradually reject and loathe him.  \\nAs time passes, he remains locked in his room, gradually weakening, and faces a death that no one grieves.  \\nThe family prepares for a new beginning with relief as soon as he dies.  \\n<br>\\nIt depicts the <mark>deletion of existence</mark> experienced by a human when they lose social function.  \\nAlthough it was published over a century ago, the theme contained in this work still deeply resonates in modern society.  \\n<br>\\n```When you become a bug, how quickly will the world abandon you?```\\n"}')}}]);